     A                                  1 10'REQUISITION APPROVAL STATUS INQUIR-
     A                                      Y - HELP SCREEN   1 OF 2'
     A                                  3  1'The fields REQ NUMBER, REQ DATE, C-
     A                                      ORP CODE, QUANTITY, UM, ESTIMATED'
     A                                  3 69'PRICE,'
     A                                  4  1'DATE WANTED, PATH, and APPROVALS L-
     A                                      EFT are defined in the help screen'
     A                                  4 70'off the'
     A                                  5  1'requisition inquiry data screen.'
     A                                  7  1'LV'
     A                                  7 11'-  APPROVAL LEVEL.  Each approval'
     A                                  7 45'level that this requisition'
     A                                  8 14'must be approved at is shown.  Lev-
     A                                      el "00" is for the originator'
     A                                  9 14'of the requisition.'
     A                                 11  1'I'
     A                                 11 11'-  IN ORDER / SIMULTANEOUS.  This'
     A                                 11 45'field shows for each level whether'
     A                                 12 14'in order or simultaneous queueing'
     A                                 12 48'is in effect.  "O" stands for'
     A                                 13 14'"in order", and "S" stands for sim-
     A                                      ultaneous.  For any req path,'
     A                                 14 14'there can be a mixture of "in orde-
     A                                      r" and "simultaneous".  For'
     A                                 15 14'example, the approval path may go'
     A                                 15 48'like this:  1.  First, Department'
     A                                 16 14'Manager   2.  Next, Engineering Ma-
     A                                      nager, Accounting, and Business'
     A                                 17 14'Center Manager simultaneously.  3.'
     A                                 17 49'Last, Plant Manager.  For this'
     A                                 18 14'example, the "in order"/"simultane-
     A                                      ous" fields for the 5 approval'
     A                                 19 14'levels would look like this:  O-S--
     A                                      S-S-O.  In two cases, "in order"'
     A                                 20 14'and "simultaneous" do not apply: f-
     A                                      or level "00", which is the'
     A                                 21 14'req originator, because this is au-
     A                                      tomatically queued and approved.'
     A                                 22 14'The second is for a req that was f-
     A                                      orwarded to another approver.'
     A                                 23 14'In these two cases this field will'
     A                                 23 49'be blank.'
     A            COMMANDLN1    79A  B 24  1DFTVAL('f2-NEXT f3-EXIT            -
     A                                                                         -
     A                                                       ')
     A                                      DSPATR(PR)
     A  98                                  OVRDTA
     A  99        MESSAGELN1    79   M
     A  99                                  OVRDTA
