     A                                  1 10'REQUISITION APPROVAL STATUS INQUIR-
     A                                      Y - HELP SCREEN   2 OF 2'
     A                                  4  1'QUE-DATE  -  REQUISITION DATE QUEU-
     A                                      ED TO APPROVER.  This shows the dat-
     A                                      e that'
     A                                  5 14'the requisition entered the approv-
     A                                      al queue of each approver.'
     A                                  6 14'This will be updated depending on'
     A                                  6 48'if the level is "in order"'
     A                                  7 14'or "simultaneous".  If all levels'
     A                                  7 48'for this approval path are'
     A                                  8 14'"simultaneous", all queued dates w-
     A                                      ill be set immediately to'
     A                                  9 14'date the req was created.  If all'
     A                                  9 48'levels for this approval path'
     A                                 10 14'are "in order", only the first app-
     A                                      rover"s queue date will be'
     A                                 11 14'updated.  When he approves the req-
     A                                      uisition, the next approvers'
     A                                 12 14'queue date will be updated, and so'
     A                                 12 49'on.  If the req has not yet'
     A                                 13 14'been put in the approvers queue, t-
     A                                      his field will be blank.'
     A                                 15  1'APP-DATE   - The date the requisit-
     A                                      ion was approved by each approver.'
     A                                 16 14'If not yet approved by the approve-
     A                                      r, this field will be blank.'
     A                                 18  1'ID'
     A                                 18 12'- Four-digit MMIS personnel system'
     A                                 18 47'identification number.'
     A                                 20  1'Name'
     A                                 20 12'- Full name of the approver from t-
     A                                      he MMIS personnel system.'
     A                                 22  1'Comments   - If the req has been f-
     A                                      orwarded to an approver, comments'
     A                                 22 69'may'
     A                                 23 14'be sent along with the forwarded r-
     A                                      eq.'
     A            COMMANDLN1    79A  B 24  1DFTVAL('                           -
     A                                                                         -
     A                                                       ')
     A                                      DSPATR(PR)
     A  98                                  OVRDTA
