     A                                  1 14'REQUISITION INQUIRY/APPROVAL HELP'
     A                                  1 48'SCREEN'
     A                                  1 61'1 OF 6'
     A                                  4  1'SORT KEY'
     A                                  4 17'-  This tells in what order you wa-
     A                                      nt the requisitions to come'
     A                                  5 20'up.  Put one of the 6 numbers in t-
     A                                      he box:'
     A                                  6 20'1  -  No sort.  Reqs will come up'
     A                                  6 54'in whatever order they'
     A                                  7 26'happen to be in.'
     A                                  8 20'2  -  Req number.  Reqs will show'
     A                                  8 54'up in ascending order'
     A                                  9 26'by the requisition number (lower n-
     A                                      umber first).'
     A                                 10 20'3  -  Workorder.  Reqs will show u-
     A                                      p in order by workorder'
     A                                 11 26'number.  Those reqs without a work-
     A                                      order will show up'
     A                                 12 26'last.'
     A                                 13 20'4  -  Budget number.  Reqs will co-
     A                                      me up in ascending order'
     A                                 14 26'by budget number.'
     A                                 15 20'5  -  Date (most recent first).  R-
     A                                      eqs will come up in'
     A                                 16 26'descending order by date.'
     A                                 17 20'6  -  Date (oldest first).  Reqs w-
     A                                      ill come up in ascending'
     A                                 18 26'order by date.'
     A            COMMANDLN1    79A  B 24  1DFTVAL('        F2-NEXT            -
     A                                                                         -
     A                                                       ')
