     A                                  1 14'REQUISITION INQUIRY/APPROVAL HELP'
     A                                  1 48'SCREEN'
     A                                  1 61'4 OF 6'
     A                                  3  1'Three of the exclude options have'
     A                                  3 35'to do with the type of code:'
     A                                  5  1'1.  Coded storeroom.  These are it-
     A                                      ems that have a corporate code and'
     A                                  5 70'are'
     A                                  6  5'handled by the storeroom.  Requisi-
     A                                      tions for coded storeroom items go'
     A                                  7  5'directly to materials control, byp-
     A                                      assing the online approval process.'
     A                                  9  1'2.  Coded non-storeroom.  These ar-
     A                                      e items that have a corporate code,-
     A                                       but'
     A                                 10  5'are not handled by the storeroom.'
     A                                 10 40'A code is classified as coded non-'
     A                                 11  5'storeroom if REORDER = 0,  EXPEDIT-
     A                                      E = 0,  and  MAX = 0.'
     A                                 13  1'3.  Non-coded.  These are items th-
     A                                      at do not have a corporate code.'
     A                                 15  1'EXCLUDE CODED STOREROOM   -  Exclu-
     A                                      des all reqs for coded storeroom it-
     A                                      ems.'
     A                                 17  1'EXCLUDE CODED NON-STORES  -  Exclu-
     A                                      des all reqs for coded non-storeroo-
     A                                      m items.'
     A                                 19  1'EXCLUDE NON-CODED'
     A                                 19 27'-  Excludes all reqs for non-coded'
     A                                 19 62'items.'
     A            COMMANDLN1    79A  B 24  1DFTVAL('F1-PREV F2-NEXT            -
     A                                                                         -
     A                                                       ')
     A                                      DSPATR(PR)
     A  98                                  OVRDTA
     A  99        MESSAGELN1    79   M
