     A                                  1 14'REQUISITION INQUIRY/APPROVAL HELP'
     A                                  1 48'SCREEN'
     A                                  1 61'5 OF 6'
     A                                  3  1'The final exclusion option is to s-
     A                                      how only reqs that are "on hold".'
     A                                  3 70'This'
     A                                  4  1'can be used by requisition origina-
     A                                      tors to find out if any of their'
     A                                  5  1'requisitions have been returned.'
     A                                  5 35'To do this, put your employee ID i-
     A                                      n the'
     A                                  6  1'Originator field, and put an "X" i-
     A                                      n the Include only "on hold" reqs'
     A                                  6 69'box.'
     A                                  8  1'If an approver returns a requisiti-
     A                                      on, the req goes into hold status'
     A                                  9  1'RETURNED, and nothing further can'
     A                                  9 35'be done to it until it is modified-
     A                                      .'
     A                                 10  1'The approver can send comments alo-
     A                                      ng with the req if it is returned.'
     A                                 11  1'Look for these in the ROUTE COMMEN-
     A                                      TS field when the data screen is br-
     A                                      ought'
     A                                 12  1'up for the returned reqs.'
     A            COMMANDLN1    79A  B 24  1DFTVAL('F1-PREV F2-NEXT            -
     A                                                                         -
     A                                                       ')
     A                                      DSPATR(PR)
     A  98                                  OVRDTA
