     A                                  1 61'6 OF 6'
     A                                  4  1'REQUSIITION NUMBER   -  Enter a re-
     A                                      q number you wish to inquire on or'
     A                                  4 70'approve.'
     A                                  5 25'Only this particular req will be b-
     A                                      rought up.'
     A                                  7  1'WORK ORDER NUMBER    -  Enter an M-
     A                                      MIS workorder number.  All requsiti-
     A                                      ons for'
     A                                  8 25'this workorder will be brought up.'
     A                                 10  1'CORPORATE CODE'
     A                                 10 22'-  Enter a storeroom corporate cod-
     A                                      e number.  All reqs'
     A                                 11 25'for this corporate code will be br-
     A                                      ought up.'
     A                                 13  1'ORIGINATOR'
     A                                 13 22'-  Enter the employee ID of any pe-
     A                                      rson in the MMIS'
     A                                 14 25'Personnel system.  All requisition-
     A                                      s that this person'
     A                                 15 25'has originated will be brought up.'
     A                                 17  1'APPROVER'
     A                                 17 22'-  Enter the employee ID of any va-
     A                                      lid person that'
     A                                 18 25'is set up to approve requisitions.'
     A                                 18 61'This will show'
     A                                 19 25'all requisitions waiting for appro-
     A                                      val by this person.'
