     A                                      d.'
     A                                 10  1'CORP CODE      -  Corporate code.'
     A                                 10 36'For non-coded items, this will rea-
     A                                      d NON-STR.'
     A                                 11 19'Coded non-storeroom items have a c-
     A                                      ode, but ONHAND, REORDER,'
     A                                 12 19'EXPEDITE, and MAX are all zero.'
     A                                 14  1'UM'
     A                                 14 16'-  The unit of measure the item is'
     A                                 14 51'requisitioned in.  For'
     A                                 15 19'coded items, this must be the stor-
     A                                      eroom UM.  For non-coded'
     A                                 16 19'items, the order UM must match the'
     A                                 16 54'price UM.'
     A                                 18  1'ESTIMATED PRICE-  Estimated unit p-
     A                                      rice of the item.'
     A                                 20  1'BUDGET AMOUNT  -  The quanity orde-
     A                                      red times the estimated unit price,-
     A                                       rounded'
     A                                 21 19'to the nearest dollar.'
     A                                 23  1'BUDGET NUMBER  -  The budget numbe-
     A                                      r under which this req falls, if an-
     A                                      y.'
