     A                                  1 47'SCREEN     2 OF 7'
     A                                  3  1'APP'
     A                                  3 16'-  Workorder cost amounts.  This i-
     A                                      s the amount approved'
     A                                  4 19'for that workorder: sum of labor e-
     A                                      stimate, stores estimate,'
     A                                  5 19'and purchasing estimate at the tim-
     A                                      e the workorder was'
     A                                  6 19'approved.'
     A                                  8  1'COMT'
     A                                  8 16'-  Workorder cost amounts.  This i-
     A                                      s the amount committed for that'
     A                                  9 19'workorder so far:  sum of labor ac-
     A                                      tual, stores actual,'
     A                                 10 19'and purchasing actual.'
     A                                 12  1'REQ'
     A                                 12 16'-  Workorder cost amounts.  This i-
     A                                      s the amount requisitioned'
     A                                 13 19'but not yet purchased.'
     A                                 15  1'AVAIL'
     A                                 15 16'-  Workorder cost amounts.  This i-
     A                                      s the amount available on the'
     A                                 16 19'workorder.  This equals the follow-
     A                                      ing:'
     A                                 17 19'WO AMT APPROVED - AMT COMMITTED +'
     A                                 17 53'AMT REQ NOT PURCH'
     A                                 19  1'Note: if the requisition is not as-
     A                                      sociated with a workorder, all thes-
     A                                      e'
     A                                 20  1'workorder cost fields will be zero-
     A                                      .'
