     A                                 14 17'-  APPROVERS ONLY.  This box allow-
     A                                      s the requisition to be'
     A                                 15 20'returned to the originator, if the'
     A                                 15 55'approver has return'
     A                                 16 20'capability.  All current queue ent-
     A                                      ries for this req will'
     A                                 17 20'be deleted, and the req will be co-
     A                                      mpletely re-queued.'
     A                                 18 20'The req will go into hold status "-
     A                                      returned", and no further'
     A                                 19 20'processing will be allowed until a'
     A                                 19 55'modification is done.'
